{"articleNo":"508112","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=508112&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025학년도 1학기 고졸 후학습자 장학사업(희망사다리II유형) 신규장학생 신청 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.03.07","hit":"8198","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 14.5pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">2025-1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">학기&nbsp;<b>고졸 후학습자 장학사업</b></span><b style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">희망사다리&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">II</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">유형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">신규장학생&nbsp;<b>신청기간</b>&nbsp;안내드리오니 많은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">신청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 14.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;대한민국 국적자로 최종학력이 고졸이며, 성적 및 재직요건을 충족한 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">성적기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">직전학기&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">점 만점의&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">70</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">점 이상</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 재직요건: 심사일 기준 재직기간이&nbsp;<b>2년 이상</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(단, 현재 중소·중견기업 재직자는&nbsp;<b>1년 이상</b>)이며, 심사일('25.1.1.) 기준 장학생 선발 대상기업에&nbsp;<b>재직 중</b>인 자<br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;<b>2025<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. 3. 5.(수) ~ 3. 21.(금) 18:00까지</span></b></span><b style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span></b>&nbsp;에서 학생 직접 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">지원내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">현 재직기업 유형 및 규모에 따라 차등 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ❍&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">중소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">중견기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">등록금 전액</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ❍&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">비영리기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">등록금의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">50%</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">의무사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금 수혜 후 <b>일정기간</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">수혜학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">×4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>재직상태</b> 유지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ ①&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">재직상태 미 이행시 장학금 반환 및 환수 절차 진행&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;② 장학금 수혜학기 재학상태를 유지하여야 하며, 수혜학기 학적변동(휴학·자퇴</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">·제적) 발생시 해당학기 장학금 전액 반환</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\">바. 문의처: 희망사다리 상담센터 1800-0499</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoQZkhrAHgEwIYCkBCBzAbgRQCsARbAFwAsBhZAezIEkAnAOkIAdsg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
